course: dictionary
lesson: 3349
title: Examination: a test or a close look
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: Examination is a long, formal word. Most of the time it means an exam: a test of what you know or can do, often written. At school you will usually just say exam, but you may see examination in letters or on signs.
explain: The word can also mean a careful look at something to study it or check it. A scientist might make a close examination of a leaf or a rock. In a doctor's surgery, a medical examination is when the doctor checks your body.
explain: Look at the clues around the word: «Some appointments happen by phone or video when no examination is needed, and the doctor decides if you must come in.» The words doctor and appointment tell you that examination means a check by a doctor. Swap in "check" and see: "when no check is needed" still makes sense.
fact: Examination is a formal word for exam, a test of what you know or can do.
fact: Examination can also mean a careful look at something to study or check it.
fact: A medical examination is when a doctor checks your body.
fact: Useful phrases: sit an examination, pass an examination, fail an examination.
exercise: At school, what is an examination usually called? | A party | *An exam | A bus stop
exercise: A scientist made a close examination of a rock. What was she doing? | *Looking closely to study it | Throwing the rock away | Eating the rock | Playing a game with it
exercise: What does a medical examination mean? | A new coat for winter | A walk around the park | *A doctor checking your body | A school test on maths
test: Mia had to sit an examination on Monday. What does sit an examination mean here? | *Take a test | Buy a new book | Sit on a chair in the hall | Miss the bus
test: The nurse said, «No examination is needed today.» What does examination mean here? | A trip to the shops | A type of food | *A check by a doctor | A school test
exam: Which sentence uses examination to mean a careful look? | *The scientist made a close examination of the rock | I passed my examination in July, so I am happy | The bus left at nine o'clock | The doctor's bag is black
